This repository is source-available, not open source. It is published so the
work can be read, not reused. No license is granted to any part of it.

This repository is the source of robertritacca.com: a personal portfolio, its
writing, and the application code that renders them. It used to also hold a
design system, which was MIT licensed. That system now lives in its own
repository as rift-ds, and it keeps that license. Nothing in this repository
carries it any more.


================================================================================
What this covers
================================================================================

Everything authored here, including:

  - The application code: layouts, routing, components, hooks, styles, the
    generator and validator scripts, and configuration.
  - Written prose on any page: body copy, headings, descriptions, and
    microcopy across the website and the specification documents.
  - Case studies and the client work they describe
    (website/src/app/work/, website/src/data/case-studies.json).
  - Essays and long-form writing
    (website/src/app/writing/, website/src/data/essays.json).
  - Photographs, illustrations, client logos, cover images, and other media.
  - The name "Rob Ritacca", the RR logo and wordmark, and any likeness,
    photograph, biography, or professional history of Rob Ritacca.


